            "q_id": "q_1d1a6af7-1bd8-4a1d-9191-0d21f00290b6",
            "text": "Which of the following is NOT a type of Operating System?",
            "options": [
                "Batch OS",
                "Real-time OS",
                "Distributed OS",
                "Relational OS"
            ],
            "correct_answer": "Relational OS",
            "marks": 1
        },
        {
            "q_id": "q_4f02ddb5-f4c4-4f5a-b911-1a67ef9a9e02",
            "text": "The core component of the Operating System that manages system resources is the:",
            "options": [
                "Shell",
